	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Celeberrime antistes<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>saepius nunc ad te scribo, vel quia opera tua indigeo, non tam mea quam ami<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>corum causa, vel quod me nimis acriter torquet ista mora literarum tuarum, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>que significent te meas accepisse; nam his erudiri optime potuisti, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>quam inique evomerint in me convicia illa pessimi detractores.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Quodsi nimis morosus tibi videbor, non mihi, sed causę huic ad<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scribe, quę cum in dei contumeliam verti ceperit, quotidie me magis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>urget, donec omnibus sit patefacta, quomoso sese habeat.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Itaque, quam primum poteris, significabis, num cumulate sit tibi et cęteris <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in ea re satisfactum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Curabo enim, ut in dies de me rectius sentias.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Cęterum fratrem hunc tibi vehementer commendo, in quo non tam unius <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hominis personam, sed integram ecclesiam, si volueris, complecti poteris; <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>est enim is carissimus fratribus <placeName ref="l104">Cremonensibus</placeName>, quem isthuc mittunt <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>pro emendis libris.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Huic si quid pręstiteris, scito te illis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>contulisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Digna est mehercle illa ecclesia opera tua, quę prę cęteris <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>aliis Christum amat, tuetur ac fovet.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tu vere, m <persName ref="p495">Bulingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>adversus hominum perfidia vindica fratris tui innocentiam.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale meque [<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dil]igas.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Datum ex latebra mea 17. februarii 1550.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Tui observantissimus <persName ref="p152">B[al<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>thasar] A[lterius</persName><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>].</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Pietate et eruditione clarissimo [Ch]rist<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>i ministro domino <persName ref="p495">Henryco [<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>B]ulingero</persName>, domino ac fratri semper <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
